  "VmHWM": "guest shell loop reads /proc/<pid>/status (VmHWM, VmRSS) of the capstone-vexec process with builtins, then usleep 100000; the effective interval is in sample_interval_s. VmHWM_kB_sampled_last is the last VmHWM read",
